 <h5>Bessel functions</h5>
 <p>
  Bessel functions of the first kind -
  <span class="eq">
   <var>J</var>
   (
   <var>n</var>
   ;
   <var>x</var>
   )  =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>π</var>
   </span>
   ·
   <span class="dvr">
    <small>
     <var>π</var>
    </small>
    <span class="nary">
     <em>∫</em>
    </span>
    <small>0</small>
   </span>
   <b>cos</b>
   (
   <var>n</var>
   ·
   <var>θ</var>
   −
   <var>x</var>
   ·
   <b>sin</b>
   (
   <var>θ</var>
   )  )  d
   <var>θ</var>
  </span>
 </p>
